    LOCALSTATE, these are the variables existing on the page
    you are on right now.
    
    GLOBALSTATE, these variables exist everywhere.
    
    TRANSFERSTATE, this acts more like a buffer for
    transferring things between localstates.
    (Used with page redirects from POST requests, maybe
    with components as well etc.)

For testing, make these just global querymaps.
